  (text "IGN: slot switched 12 V (on with the key) -> 33k / 10k (14.5 V -> 3.4 V, clamped; HIGH from about 6 V), on an ADC pin.\nBATT: slot constant 12 V -> 100k / 22k (16 V -> 2.9 V) on ADC IN7.\nWAKE: PWR_HOLD (3.3 V GPIO) -> Schottky -> slot WAKE: keeps the main board's 5 V on after key-off. WAKE -> 47k -> ADC IN8 (another card woke the rail)." (at 220 51 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c1863bd8-386e-5f78-b469-cc0315def119"))
