  (text "POWER: slot +5 V -> AP2112K-3.3 (600 mA): the MCU, the transceiver VIO, the FRAM, the sender pull-up banks (up to about 130 mA with every bank shorted), the clamps. The sender feeds (ETEMP V, OILP V) and the speed sensor stay on 5 V." (at 20 173.18 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f54eda2f-6bfa-5a3d-8e1c-5133e72afd9a"))
