  (text "MCU: STM32G0B1KBU6 (UFQFPN-32), 3.3 V, 8 MHz HSE (CAN bit timing). Every I/O pin is used: pin map in SensorCard2/README.md" (at 470 45 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f57c35da-2ae6-59c6-a8ec-f60723c0ebda"))
  (text "PA11 / PA12 FDCAN1 RX / TX (AF3). PA9 / PA10 USART1 TX / RX (AF1): debug serial J7 (also the ROM bootloader). PA2 / PA3 USART2 TX / RX (AF1): sensor serial J8 (TX through a 3.3 -> 5 V level shifter).\nPB6 / PB7 I2C1 SCL / SDA (AF6): FRAM. PA8 TIM1_CH1 (AF2): tach. PB4 TIM3_CH1 (AF1): speed. ADC: PA0 fuel, PA1 engine temp, PA4 oil pressure, PA5 ambient, PA6 alternator L, PA7 battery, PB0 WAKE, PB1 ignition.\nPB2 / PC6 / PB9: temp feed monitor, oil feed monitor (digital: feed present), RPM select A. PB3 RPM select B. PA15 PWR_HOLD. PB5 LED. PA13 / PA14 SWD (BOOT0 shares PA14). PC14 / PC15 the crystal. PF2 NRST." (at 670 51 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7f88d7b4-7b02-513f-9d65-747dddb94b95"))
  (symbol (lib_id "SensorCard2:STM32G0B1KBU6") (at 518.16 93.98 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "0a9d4f72-e091-5287-8d3b-5709bb92ab35")
    (property "Reference" "U1" (at 495.3 67.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)))
