  (text "SENDERS (J2, JST PH 12 pin, top edge). Each channel: a topology jumper (pull-up to +3V3 or pull-down to GND) feeding a bank of resistors, each behind its own solder jumper. Bridge one value (two give them in parallel). 10k + 10 nF into the ADC, clamped to 3.3 V." (at 20 333.28 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "474068f7-dbef-5f43-841d-9c5dc477ea0c"))
