  (text "As delivered: every channel pull-up (topology jumper 1-2); FUEL 100R (the factory 0-30R sender), ETEMP 1k, OILP 220R, AMB 100k bridged.\nThe pull-ups come from +3V3 and the ADC reference is the same 3.3 V, so a resistive sender reads ratiometrically, as rev A did at 5 V: the same counts.\nPull-down mode (a 3-wire transducer fed from the channel's 5 V pin): the ADC pin clamps at 3.3 V, so fit the channel's DIV resistor (20k: 10k / 20k = 2/3) to read a 0.5-4.5 V output in full. Sender selection: SensorCard/DATASHEET.md." (at 220 339.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "853077cc-4b4c-5293-be61-027043ea5a88"))
